stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  state "PROPOSED 合同与策略检查" as Proposed
  state "AWAITING_APPROVAL 待批准" as Await
  state "READY 具备候选条件" as Ready
  state "REJECTED 硬拒绝" as Rejected
  state "CLAIMED 复验并消费授权" as Claimed
  state "DISPATCHING 先落盘再派发" as Dispatching
  state "SUCCEEDED 明确成功" as Succeeded
  state "FAILED 明确失败" as Failed
  state "UNKNOWN 结果不明" as Unknown
  state "核对远端或请求用户确认" as Reconcile
  [*] --> Proposed
  Proposed --> Await: ASK
  Proposed --> Ready: ALLOW
  Proposed --> Rejected: DENY
  Await --> Ready: 批准事务提交
  Ready --> Claimed: 原子 claim
  Claimed --> Dispatching: 复核取消 epoch 资源并落盘本 Attempt 的 dispatch_id
  Claimed --> Ready: 旧 runtime 已隔离且确认未派发并复验原 grant
  Dispatching --> Succeeded: 可验证成功
  Dispatching --> Failed: 可验证失败
  Dispatching --> Unknown: 超时或失联且缺少终态
  Unknown --> Reconcile: 禁止自动重发
  note right of Claimed
    CONSUMED 不回退
    同 Operation 安全重试沿用消费关系并复验
    dispatch_id 属于 Attempt
    Provider 幂等键属于 Operation
  end note
  Succeeded --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
